<title>HUNGARY: SOCCER-HUNGARY BEAT FINLAND 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HUNGARY BEAT FINLAND 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary beat Finland 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in their World Cup soccer European group 3</p>
<p>qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Ferenc Orosz (16th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
<p> Norway	    1   1   0   0   5   0   3</p>
<p> Azerbaijan	2   1   0   1   1   5   3</p>
<p> Hungary	   1   1   0   0   1   0   3</p>
<p> Finland	   1   0   0   1   0   1   0</p>
<p> Switzerland     1   0   0   1   0   1   0</p>
<p>Next match: Finland v Switzerland, October 6.</p>
</text>
